|---|---|
| `.ping` | Edits message to `PONG` |
| `.id` | Shows Your ID, Current Chat ID, and Current Message ID |
| `.help` | Opens interactive inline help panel |
| `.health` | Full health dashboard |
| `.panel` | Context panel for the replied message |

